    reveal: [["r", "She halved the doses on her own because she was afraid of weight gain."], ["v", "She has not had her thyroid checked in a year and stopped levothyroxine for some weeks."], ["t", "She takes a 'mood herbal' capsule daily that she has not mentioned to any doctor."]],
    risk: "Asked clearly: long-standing passive wish not to wake, no plan, no attempts. Hopelessness about treatment raises risk; review regularly.",
