    dx: "Major depressive disorder, pseudo-resistant (inadequate trials, untreated hypothyroidism)",
    ddx: [["Treatment-resistant depression", "Needs at least two adequate trials (adequate dose and duration, taken as prescribed); she has not had one"], ["Bipolar depression", "No hypomania so far; ask carefully because it changes treatment"], ["Hypothyroid-related low mood", "Stopped levothyroxine and has not been checked; correct this first"]],
    rubric: ["Reviewed each past trial for dose, duration and adherence", "Asked about thyroid treatment and supplements", "Asked about suicide clearly", "Respected her knowledge without dismissing or caving", "Agreed a single adequate trial with side-effect planning"],
